title: Coalition Meeting
new-page: true
is-card: true
tags: party_affairs
view-if: coalition_meeting_timer <= 0
on-arrival: month_actions += 1; coalition_meeting_timer += 3

= Coalition Meeting

The organizations and political circles cooperating with Mossadegh do not yet
constitute a disciplined party. A meeting can settle immediate priorities, but
not erase their different interests.

- @shared_program: Draft a narrow shared program
- @open_floor: Give every tendency room to state its priorities

@shared_program
on-arrival: coalition_cohesion += 6; constitutional_legitimacy += 2; iran_party_relation += 2; toilers_relation -= 1
go-to: post_event

The meeting agrees to concentrate on representative elections and constitutional
government. Broader disagreements remain outside the common program.

@open_floor
on-arrival: coalition_cohesion += 3; toilers_relation += 2; muslim_warriors_relation += 2; political_intelligence += 2
go-to: post_event

The discussion exposes disagreements, but the secretariat leaves with a clearer
picture of what each circle expects from cooperation.
